### Eligible pair (MSISDN + NID not in the blacklist)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/eligibility/check
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "msisdn": "201055555555",
  "nid": "29901011234560"
}

### Blacklisted pair with multiple flags
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/eligibility/check
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "msisdn": "201066257228",
  "nid": "29901011234567"
}

### Same MSISDN, different NID (eligible when only the pair above is listed)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/eligibility/check
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "msisdn": "201066257228",
  "nid": "25505051234561"
}

### Invalid NID
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/eligibility/check
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "msisdn": "201055555555",
  "nid": "123"
}

### Operational status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/system/status
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Liveness
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/actuator/health/liveness

### Readiness
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/actuator/health/readiness
